```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant GSC as GradingStreamController
    participant GP as GradingPipeline
    participant ZE as ZipExtractor
    participant SN as StructureNormalizer
    participant IR as IdentityResolver
    participant GE as GradingEngine
    participant PR as ProcessRunner
    participant REP as Reporters

    FE->>GSC: POST /api/grading/stream (multipart: ZIPs + testers)
    GSC-->>FE: SSE session event {sessionId}
    GSC->>GP: run(submissionsDir, testersDir, scoresheet, outputDir)

    GP->>ZE: scan + extract all ZIPs
    GSC-->>FE: SSE status "Extracting submissions..."

    loop For each student
        GP->>SN: normalize folder structure
        GP->>IR: resolve identity from Java headers
        GP->>GE: grade(submissionRoot, testersDir, configs, submission)

        loop For each question
            GE->>PR: compile (javac)
            GE->>PR: run (java tester)
            PR-->>GE: ProcessResult (score, stdout, stderr)
        end

        GSC-->>FE: SSE student event {username, totalScore, results}
    end

    GP->>REP: ScoresheetEnricher.enrich(submissions, csv)
    GP->>REP: PdfReportGenerator.generate()
    GP->>REP: CSVExporter.export() + DetailedCsvExporter.export()
    GP->>REP: PlagiarismChecker.runChecks()

    GSC-->>FE: SSE complete event {runId, totalStudents}
```
